<document name="Waiver">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="center"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="240"><b>PARENTAL PERMISSION &amp; HEALTH AUTHORIZATION FORM</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="center"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="center"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Dirt Bowl</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="0"><row><cell width="4440"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">PLAYER'S NAME:</font></division></cell><cell width="255"></cell><cell width="6090"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></font><sp/><font size="180"><field name="Registration:LastName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4423"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180" color="000000">BIRTH DATE:</font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="720"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180" color="000000"><field name="Registration:RegAgeMo"/></font><font size="180" color="000000">/</font><font size="180" color="000000"><field name="Registration:RegAgeDay"/></font><font size="180" color="000000">/</font><font size="180" color="000000"><field name="Registration:RegAgeYr"/></font></division></cell><cell width="510"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180" color="000000">SEX:</font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="4603"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180" color="000000"><field name="Registration:Sex"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4425"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">PARENT/GUARDIAN NAME:</font></division></cell><cell width="300"></cell><cell width="6045"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:ParentFirstName"/></font><sp/><font size="180"><field name="Registration:ParentLastName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4425"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">ADDRESS: </font></division></cell><cell width="300"></cell><cell width="6045"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:Address"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4425"></cell><cell width="300"></cell><cell width="6045"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:City"/></font><font size="180">, CA </font><font size="180"><field name="Registration:Zip"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4410"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180"> PHONE  HOME:</font></division></cell><cell width="315"></cell><cell width="6075"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:ParentHomePhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4410"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">WORK:</font></division></cell><cell width="315"></cell><cell width="6075"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:ParentHomePhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="4410"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">CELL:</font></division></cell><cell width="315"></cell><cell width="6075"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:ParentWorkPhone"/></font></division></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="right"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="180"><b>I/We, the parent/guardian(s) of </b></font><font size="180"><b><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></b></font><sp/><font size="180"><b><field name="Registration:LastName"/></b></font><font size="180"><b> hereby give My/Our permission for his/her participation in DIRT BOWL sports and recreation activities.  I/We agree to direct My/Our child to cooperate and conform to directions and instructions of DIRT BOWL personnel responsible for DIRT BOWL activities.</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="180"><b>I/We understand that there are certain risks of injury inherent in the practice and play of this sport, as well as in traveling and other related activities incidental to my child's participation, and I am willing to assume these risks on behalf of my child.  I hereby certify that my child is fully capable of participating in the designated sport and that my child is healthy and has no physical or mental disabilities or infirmities that would restrict full participation in these activities, except as listed here:</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="180"><b>__________________________________________________________________________</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="180"><b>In addition to giving my full consent for my child's participation, I do hereby waive, release and hold harmless the Dirt Bowl, its officers, coaches, sponsors, supervisors and representatives for any injury that may be suffered by my child in the normal course of participation in the game of basketball and the activities incidental thereto, whether the result of negligence or any other cause.</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="180"><b>If the Parent/Guardian or Emergency Contact cannot be reached in an emergency, I/We hereby give permission for whatever medical treatment may be considered necessary by a physician or hospital for My/Our child.</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="0"><row><cell width="5835"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">PARENT/GUARDIAN SIGNATURE:</font></division></cell><cell width="345"><division indent="0" align="right"><sp/><sp/></division></cell><cell width="2190"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180">______________________</font></division></cell><cell width="795"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">DATE:</font></division></cell><cell width="345"></cell><cell width="1290"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180">______________</font></division></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="0"><row><cell width="6420"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180"> Child's Physician:</font></division></cell><cell width="210"><division indent="0" align="left"><sp/></division></cell><cell width="4170"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:DocName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="6420"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">Phone:</font></division></cell><cell width="210"><division indent="0" align="left"><sp/></division></cell><cell width="4170"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:DocPhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="6420"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">Address:</font></division></cell><cell width="210"><division indent="0" align="left"><sp/></division></cell><cell width="4170"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:DocAddress"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="6420"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">Medical  Insurance Plan Name:</font></division></cell><cell width="210"><division indent="0" align="left"><sp/></division></cell><cell width="4170"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:MedPlanName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="6420"><division indent="0" align="right"><font size="180">Plan Number:</font></division></cell><cell width="210"><division indent="0" align="left"><sp/></division></cell><cell width="4170"><division indent="0" align="left"><font size="180"><field name="Registration:MedPlanNumber"/></font></division></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="180"><i>Sign and return to: </i></font><font size="180"><b>Dirt Bowl, </b></font><font size="180"><b><field name="AdminAdrss"/></b></font><font size="180"><b>, </b></font><font size="180"><b><field name="AdminsCity"/></b></font><font size="180"><b>, </b></font><font size="180"><b><field name="AdminState"/></b></font><sp/><font size="180"><b><field name="AdminsZIP"/></b></font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="RecruitDB">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="Recruitment" project="">Back to Recruitment</invitation></u></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">Number of records: </font><font color="000000"><record-count version="3"><form-name>RecruitmentDB</form-name><conditions><form name="RecruitmentDB" /></conditions></record-count></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><itemization-table version="1"><number-of-columns>5</number-of-columns><column><header>First Name</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:FirstName" /></contents></column><column><header>Last Name</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:LastName" /></contents></column><column><header>Parent</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:ParentFirst" /></contents></column><column><header>Email</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:Email" /></contents></column><column><header>Phone</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:Phone" /></contents></column><conditions><form name="RecruitmentDB" /></conditions></itemization-table></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="Recruitment" project="">Back to Recruitment</invitation></u></font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="RecruitDBContacts">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><itemization-table version="1"><number-of-columns>4</number-of-columns><column><header>First Name</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:FirstName" /></contents></column><column><header>Last Name</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:LastName" /></contents></column><column><header>Email</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:Email" /></contents></column><column><header># Emails Sent</header><contents><field name="Record:RecruitmentDB:ContactsNo" /></contents></column><conditions><form name="RecruitmentDB" /><conditions>
<isLessThan field="Record:RecruitmentDB:ContactsNo">
<string field="Count"/>
</isLessThan>
</conditions></conditions></itemization-table></font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="RegReview">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="790000"><i>Please review the following information.  If it is not correct or if you need to change it in the future, you can reaccess your Registration form by following this link:</i></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000080"><u><invitation form="PlayerDash" project="" private="true"><authenticationTokenValue><string field="Registration:RegID"/>
</authenticationTokenValue>Player's Dashboard</invitation></u></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="790000"><i>(An email containing this link to your personal Dirt Bowl dashboard has also been sent to you.)</i></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000"><b>Your Registration Information:</b></font></paragraph><table indent="735"><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Player's Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></font><sp/><font><field name="Registration:LastName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Date of Birth:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:RegAgeMo"/></font><font>/</font><font><field name="Registration:RegAgeDay"/></font><font>/</font><font><field name="Registration:RegAgeYr"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Sex:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:Sex"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Parent's Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentFirstName"/></font><sp/><font><field name="Registration:ParentLastName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Address:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:Address"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:City"/></font><font>, CA </font><font><field name="Registration:Zip"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Email:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentEmail"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Home Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentHomePhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Work Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentWorkPhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Mobile:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentMobilePhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Friends Requested:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:Friend:a"/></font><sp/><sp/><sp/><font><field name="Registration:Friend:b"/></font><sp/><sp/><sp/><font><field name="Registration:Friend:c"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Shirt Size:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="Registration:UniformSize"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Medical Plan Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:MedPlanName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Plan Number:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:MedPlanNumber"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Doctor Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="Registration:DocName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Doctor Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="Registration:DocPhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Doctor Address:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="Registration:DocAddress"/></font></division></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="right"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="right"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font size="280">Thank you for registering for Dirt Bowl!</font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="PlayerDashboard">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="0"><row><cell width="10800"><division indent="0" align="center"><font face="Times New Roman" size="360"><b><field name="PlayerFirst"/></b></font><sp/><sp/><font face="Times New Roman" size="360"><b><field name="PlayerLast"/></b></font><font face="Times New Roman" size="360"><b>'s Dirt Bowl Player Dashboard</b></font></division></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="0"><row><cell width="2010"></cell><cell width="4590"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000080"><u><invitation form="EditMyRegistrationRecord" project="">View/Edit Registration &amp; Waiver</invitation></u></font></division></cell><cell width="795"></cell><cell width="1695"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000080"><u><link><description><string value="Schedule"/></description><url><string value="http://www.dirtbowl.com/Site/Welcome.html"/></url></link></u></font></division></cell><cell width="1695"></cell></row><row><cell width="2010"></cell><cell width="4590"></cell><cell width="795"></cell><cell width="1695"></cell><cell width="1695"></cell></row><row><cell width="2010"></cell><cell width="4590"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Payment Status: </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="PaymentStatusMessage"/></font><sp/></division></cell><cell width="795"></cell><cell width="1695"></cell><cell width="1695"></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Your Team: </b></font><font><b><field name="Team"/></b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>League: </b></font><font><field name="League"/></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Season: </b></font><font><field name="SeasonYr"/></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="0"><row><cell width="2415"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Coach:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2548"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Coach"/></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2818"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Dirt Bowl Administrator:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="200"></cell><cell width="2245"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="AdminName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2415"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Coach's Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2548"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="CoachsPhone"/></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2818"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Dirt Bowl Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="200"></cell><cell width="2245"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="AdminsPhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2415"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Alternate Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2548"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="CoachsPhone1"/></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2818"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Administrator Address:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="200"></cell><cell width="2245"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="AdminAdrss"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2415"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Email:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2548"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="CoachsEmail"/></font></division></cell><cell width="272"></cell><cell width="2818"></cell><cell width="200"></cell><cell width="2245"><division indent="0" align="left"><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="AdminsCity"/></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">, </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="AdminState"/></font><sp/><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><field name="AdminsZIP"/></font></division></cell></row></table>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="SaveThisLink">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Dear </font><font><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></font><font>,</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Thank you for registering for this season's Dirt Bowl.  This email is to acknowledge </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>your registration.  However, don't forget -- your registration is not complete until your</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>$90 payment and your medical waiver have been received.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Both the payment and the waiver can be mailed to the following address:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Dirt Bowl</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><field name="AdminAdrss"/></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><field name="AdminsCity"/></font><sp/><font><field name="AdminState"/></font><font>, </font><font><field name="AdminsZIP"/></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>If you need any information about the season, you can always look at our Web site </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>at http://www.dirtbowl.com.  For dealing with personal information like reviewing or </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>changing your registration info, checking your team roster or schedule and the like, </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>use the link below.  This is your personal link.  Do not share it with others.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Here it is:  </font><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="PlayerDash" project="" private="true"><authenticationTokenValue><string field="Registration:RegID"/>
</authenticationTokenValue>Player's Dashboard</invitation></u></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>To save this link, click on it.  A Dirt Bowl Web page will come up, your personal page. </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Saving this link depends upon which brower you use:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>If you use Internet Explorer, click on "Favorites" in the Menu Bar at top and </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>then "Add to Favorites."</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>If you use Firefox, click on "Bookmarks" in the Menu Bar at top and then </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>"Bookmark this Page."</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>If you use Safari, click on "Bookmarks" and then "Add Bookmarks."</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>You'll get your team roster and schedule by email once they've been completed, but </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>they will also always be available to you on your Dashboard.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>I'm looking forward to seeing you at the Dirt Bowl games this season!</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Yours,</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><field name="AdminName"/></font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="AdminRegNotifiction">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>A registration form has been received for </font><font><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></font><sp/><font><field name="Registration:LastName"/></font><font>. Here is the registration info:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><table indent="735"><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Player's Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></font><sp/><font><field name="Registration:LastName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Date of Birth:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:RegAgeMo"/></font><font>/</font><font><field name="Registration:RegAgeDay"/></font><font>/</font><font><field name="Registration:RegAgeYr"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Sex:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:Sex"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Parent's Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentFirstName"/></font><sp/><font><field name="Registration:ParentLastName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Address:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:Address"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:City"/></font><font>, CA </font><font><field name="Registration:Zip"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Email:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentEmail"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Home Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentHomePhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Work Phone:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentWorkPhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Mobile:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:ParentMobilePhone"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Friends Requested:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:Friend:a"/></font><sp/><sp/><sp/><font><field name="Registration:Friend:b"/></font><sp/><sp/><sp/><font><field name="Registration:Friend:c"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Shirt Size:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font color="000000"><field name="Registration:UniformSize"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Medical Plan Name:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:MedPlanName"/></font></division></cell></row><row><cell width="2205"><division indent="0" align="right"><font><b>Plan Number:</b></font></division></cell><cell width="330"></cell><cell width="7530"><division indent="0" align="left"><font><field name="Registration:MedPlanNumber"/></font></division></cell></row></table><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">In case of loss, here is the link to </font><font color="000000"><field name="Registration:FirstName"/></font><font color="000000">'s private </font><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="PlayerDash" project="" private="true"><authenticationTokenValue><string field="Registration:RegID"/>
</authenticationTokenValue>Player Dashboard</invitation></u></font><font color="000000">.</font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="PlayerDashboardReminder">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Dear </font><font><field name="PlayerFirst"/></font><font>,</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Your personal Dirt Bowl link is </font><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="PlayerRegLink" project="" private="true"><authenticationTokenValue><string field="PlayerID"/>
</authenticationTokenValue>here</invitation></u></font><font>.  Clicking on this link will take you to </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>your private Dirt Bowl Player Dashboard.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">To save this link, click on it.  A Dirt Bowl Web page will come up, your personal page. </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">Saving this link depends upon which brower you use:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">If you use Internet Explorer, click on "Favorites" in the Menu Bar at top and </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">then "Add to Favorites."</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">If you use Firefox, click on "Bookmarks" in the Menu Bar at top and then </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">"Bookmark this Page."</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="720" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="720"/><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000000">If you use Safari, click on "Bookmarks" and then "Add Bookmarks."</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Be sure to save this link in a safe place.  You can use it to review or </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>change your registration and to see personal information, such as your </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>team assignment and team roster, season schedule and the like.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>For general information about Dirt Bowl, you can always go to: </font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>http://www.dirtbowl.com.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Yours,</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><field name="AdminName"/></font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="Message">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="AE0000"><b><i><field name="Message"/></i></b></font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
